notes = ("LEGO rebuilt on Brickset-style axes: 13 significant themes as archetypes (Town/City, Castle, Space, Technic, Duplo, Star Wars, Icons, Ideas, "
 "Architecture, Harry Potter, Bionicle, Ninjago, Friends) with sourced landmark sets as versions; the 140-theme flat range list cut to ~56 stubs "
 "(dropped non-set or marginal entries such as Dimensions, Games, Nike, PlayStation, LEGOLAND, Factory, Bricks and More, Xtra, Znap, Quatro/Primo/Baby "
 "which sit under Duplo). Added Mega, COBI and BlueBrixx as other brick systems. New kinds: Minifigure, Magnetic tile set, Rod-and-connector set. "
 "Anchor Stone Blocks sit in Wooden construction set as a 'Stone blocks' type. Märklin Metall and Lincoln Logs not added (no page retrieved). "
 "Kapla country left blank (page only says Dutch inventor). Old Tegu models kept in m; KEVA and Hubelino old models became versions.")
